                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Even among borrowers in the Low behavioral-risk tier, exposure tiers separated default rates by approximately </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8' italic='true'>6.1×,</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8' italic='true'> indicating that exposure adds information beyond behavioral risk history alone.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
