                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='12667' id='9' type-v2='text' w='44875' x='1000' y='82000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d4af37' fontsize='12'>Insight</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#a9b4c2'>• </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#a9b4c2' fontname='Google Sans Text'>Placeholder delinquency codes (96/98) showed a 54.65% default rate versus a 6.60% baseline.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#a9b4c2'>• </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#a9b4c2' fontname='Google Sans Text'>Borrowers in their 30s and lowest income quartile defaulted at 12.49%, nearly twice the portfolio average.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#a9b4c2'>• </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#a9b4c2' fontname='Google Sans Text'>A single 30–59 day delinquency was associated with nearly 6× higher serious-default risk.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='5' />
                    <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius-bottom-left' value='0' />
                    <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius-bottom-right' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='12667' id='1' type-v2='text' w='44813' x='45875' y='82000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d4af37' fontsize='12'>Recommendation</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#a9b4c2'>• </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#a9b4c2' fontname='Google Sans Text'>Investigate anomalous values before removing them, unusual codes may contain powerful risk signals.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#a9b4c2'>• </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#a9b4c2' fontname='Google Sans Text'>Strengthen underwriting for vulnerable borrower segments, particularly younger, lower-income borrowers.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#a9b4c2'>• </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#a9b4c2' fontname='Google Sans Text'>Trigger early intervention at the first 30–59 day delinquency, rather than waiting for 90+ days past due.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='5' />
