              <zone fixed-size='114' friendly-name='HC - Insight &amp; Recommendation' h='13111' id='28' is-fixed='true' layout-strategy-id='distribute-evenly' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='89625' x='1000' y='81556'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='12667' id='9' type-v2='text' w='44813' x='1000' y='82000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d4af37' fontsize='12'>Insight</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#a9b4c2'>• </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#a9b4c2' fontname='Google Sans Text'>Credit-line risk is non-linear: borrowers with 0 open lines had a 25.6% default rate, while 16+ lines also showed elevated risk.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#a9b4c2'>• </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#a9b4c2' fontname='Google Sans Text'>Household dependency compounds income risk: low-income borrowers with 3+ dependents defaulted at more than twice the rate of comparable borrowers with no dependents.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#a9b4c2'>• </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#a9b4c2' fontname='Google Sans Text'>Risk is multi-factor: age, income, credit lines, and dependents all contribute to borrower differentiation.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
